    <span class="wrap cta-band-inner">
      <span class="cta-band-title">Throwing a party?</span>
      <span class="cta-band-action">Submit your event <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
    </span>
  </a>

  <div class="wrap footer-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="footer-brand">Cologne Raves</p>
      <p>A community-run calendar of techno parties, raves, and club nights in Cologne. No ads, no cookies, maintained by volunteers from the Cologne Ravers WhatsApp group.</p>
      <p lang="de">Der Community-Kalender für Techno-Partys, Raves und elektronische Musik in Köln. Werbefrei, ohne Cookies, von Ravern für Raver.</p>
